WEBVTT

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:47.100
The body of a woman that was found
in the river in September of this year

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:49.190
was determined to be
the victim of suicide.

00:00:49.190 --> 00:00:52.150
But recently, police have found new clues.

00:00:52.150 --> 00:00:54.900
It's said that the possibility of
homicide can't be ruled out.

00:00:57.240 --> 00:00:58.950
But whatever the cause of death,

00:00:58.950 --> 00:01:01.450
we hope that our female friends around us

00:01:01.450 --> 00:01:03.160
enhance their self-protection
and awareness

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:04.790
of their physical and mental health.

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:08.960
All right.

00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:11.960
Such a heavy topic shouldn't be continued
on such a beautiful morning.

00:01:11.960 --> 00:01:14.090
Let's enjoy the next song.

00:01:39.820 --> 00:01:41.450
Lu Guang?

00:01:41.450 --> 00:01:43.870
Who is he?

00:01:43.870 --> 00:01:45.540
I just want to ask about that,

00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:48.290
why was he stalking you?

00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:49.830
You've got it wrong,

00:01:49.830 --> 00:01:50.880
my name is Chen Xiao.

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:52.420
I'm an architect.

00:01:52.420 --> 00:01:56.470
It's spread around the internet
that someone can enter the photo.

00:01:56.470 --> 00:01:58.590
So, you are a guest from far away.

00:01:58.590 --> 00:02:00.220
Sorry, that was rude.

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:02.550
But why are you sneaking around like this?

00:02:02.550 --> 00:02:04.470
There are all kinds of
sayings flying around.

00:02:04.470 --> 00:02:06.730
Some say the boss is a fair lady;

00:02:06.730 --> 00:02:10.100
some say she's an old witch.

00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:12.480
What? An old witch?

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:16.190
I'm afraid of being cheated,
so I'm planning to spy on it secretly.

00:02:16.190 --> 00:02:17.240
My fairy.

00:02:17.240 --> 00:02:18.490
Please help me,

00:02:18.490 --> 00:02:19.450
if you really can do this...

00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:21.530
Enough, don't call me fairy,

00:02:21.530 --> 00:02:22.700
Qiao Qiao will be fine.

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:24.160
JO...JO?

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:27.250
Not JO JO! It's Qiao Qiao!

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:44.320
Hey? Isn't this the picture
I developed several days ago?

00:03:45.280 --> 00:03:47.410
Our old witch can really run it.

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:48.620
Tell me about it.

00:03:48.620 --> 00:03:49.620
Our client

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:51.660
was a bench player on
the school basketball team

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:53.210
and the photographer of
the school newspaper.

00:03:53.210 --> 00:03:56.210
This is our photo together
before the last game.

00:03:56.210 --> 00:03:58.590
It was the most
unforgettable day of my life.

00:03:58.590 --> 00:04:00.170
I lost the game,

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:02.010
missed my puppy love,

00:04:02.010 --> 00:04:04.260
and quarreled with my mom in the end.

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:06.800
So,

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:10.390
I just want to say a few words
to each of them,

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:12.390
to make up for my past regrets.

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:14.440
What do you think of this application?

00:04:14.440 --> 00:04:16.400
Is it okay?

00:04:20.190 --> 00:04:21.530
A few words?

00:04:21.530 --> 00:04:23.450
That may affect the past,

00:04:23.450 --> 00:04:25.610
you sure about this?

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:27.740
It will be fine,

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:29.370
nothing will be changed.

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:34.960
I have no doubts, let's do it!

00:04:45.970 --> 00:04:47.470
All right, let's buck up!

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:49.890
If we take this one,
we will play in the county!

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:51.310
Yeah!

00:04:55.770 --> 00:04:58.110
Chen Xiao, you stay here.

00:04:58.110 --> 00:04:59.440
You are the only back-up.

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:02.280
If anyone gets hurt,
we are counting on you.

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:04.610
--Warm up when you're free off the court.
--Okay, all right.

00:05:04.610 --> 00:05:06.780
Be prepared at all times.

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:09.200
--Long Yang Long Yang,
reign the court!
--We got lucky this year,

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:10.330
--Long Yang Long Yang,
reign the court!
--we will fight a temporary team of
miscellaneous troops at the beginning.

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:12.290
--Long Yang Long Yang,
through the storm!
--we will fight a temporary team of
miscellaneous troops at the beginning.

00:05:12.290 --> 00:05:14.200
--Long Yang Long Yang,
through the storm!
--Far from the county,
to this tiny place, to compete.

00:05:14.200 --> 00:05:15.830
--Far from the county,
to this tiny place, to compete.

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:17.960
This basketball hall
is too shabby, isn't it?

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:19.750
I think it's an awning at best.

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:22.460
--Absolutely right!
--Maybe it will collapse in half.

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:26.800
Long Yang Long Yang, reign the court!

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:30.430
Long Yang Long Yang, through the storm!

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:32.260
Gained the initiative already,

00:05:32.260 --> 00:05:34.930
this match is doomed to be boring!

00:05:36.390 --> 00:05:37.390
Chen Xiao.

00:05:37.390 --> 00:05:38.310
I'm here!

00:05:38.310 --> 00:05:39.650
Don't forget to take photos.

00:05:39.650 --> 00:05:41.190
Make sure that everyone's
looking perfect in your pictures,

00:05:41.190 --> 00:05:44.650
and the whole school can be
attracted after publishing them!

00:05:44.650 --> 00:05:45.860
Don't worry, captain,

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:47.280
I'm a professional!

00:05:53.370 --> 00:05:55.870
I can't see much with glasses
cause I'm not nearsighted,

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:58.040
can I get rid of them?

00:05:58.040 --> 00:05:59.460
There is nothing you can
help with in the match,

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:01.500
just sit there till the end.

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:05.050
Long Yang Long Yang, reign the court!

00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:08.840
Long Yang Long Yang, through the storm!

00:06:19.140 --> 00:06:20.850
Don't let him take the rhythm.

00:06:20.850 --> 00:06:22.980
Keep joint defense
and positional warfare!

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:24.110
Yeah.

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:38.120
Out of sight and no moves.

00:06:38.120 --> 00:06:40.460
It really drives me crazy!

00:06:40.460 --> 00:06:42.750
Deliver the words to him after the game,

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:44.670
the first mission will be down.

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:47.130
Before that, stay put.

00:06:47.130 --> 00:06:48.720
As the reporter of the school newspaper,

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:51.130
I can take photos!

00:06:51.130 --> 00:06:53.680
Chen Xiao! No flash!

00:06:53.680 --> 00:06:54.680
Oh my God!

00:07:00.640 --> 00:07:02.440
Dribble charging from Long Yang!

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:09.150
Lu Guang, did I just
affect the historical track?

00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:13.950
Yes, you did.

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:18.410
But the results have not changed.

00:07:20.910 --> 00:07:22.170
That's good.

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:25.420
I ran into him because of
being dazzled by

00:07:25.420 --> 00:07:27.380
their teammate's flash off-court,

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:29.340
it's not my fault!

00:07:30.670 --> 00:07:31.880
I'm sorry, captain,

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:33.390
I was careless for the moment.

00:07:33.390 --> 00:07:35.510
How is your knee?

00:07:35.510 --> 00:07:36.680
Don't worry,

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:40.020
he would make other tricks
even without you.

00:07:40.020 --> 00:07:41.520
Take my place for a while.

00:07:43.190 --> 00:07:46.110
I'll do the emergency
treatment for my knee.

00:07:46.110 --> 00:07:49.480
I'm counting on you before that.

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:51.950
Hey, Lu Guang,

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:53.660
is it in the plan?

00:07:53.660 --> 00:07:56.530
Should I play or not?

00:07:56.530 --> 00:07:58.410
The past has been disrupted by you.

00:07:58.410 --> 00:08:03.210
I can't foretell what would happen
before they lost the game.

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:09.500
Okay, I'll try my best!

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:12.380
The back-up replaces the main force,

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:14.090
why don't you just give up the game?

00:08:14.090 --> 00:08:16.050
Back to your positions!

00:08:17.550 --> 00:08:19.060
Shit...

00:08:24.140 --> 00:08:25.350
Defense quickly!

00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:55.680
Shit!

00:08:55.680 --> 00:08:58.350
I won't lose basketball games

00:08:58.350 --> 00:08:59.760
to anyone.

00:09:03.270 --> 00:09:05.690
Don't stand there, newcomer.

00:09:05.690 --> 00:09:07.940
Would you like to join us?

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:10.730
Come on!

00:09:10.730 --> 00:09:11.780
Damn it!

00:09:11.780 --> 00:09:12.900
Defend carefully,

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:14.650
watch around!

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:16.610
When did this guy get so strong?

00:09:16.610 --> 00:09:17.450
Defense!

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:18.620
Okay!

00:09:39.470 --> 00:09:41.310
Whoa, Chen Xiao,
you're just like Kobe today,

00:09:41.310 --> 00:09:42.680
is that really you?

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:43.560
That was awesome.

00:09:43.560 --> 00:09:44.640
--It's wonderful, Chen Xiao.
--Where did you learn those tricks?

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:45.850
--It's wonderful, Chen Xiao.
--How do you become so strong?

00:09:45.850 --> 00:09:47.230
Well done, boy.

00:09:47.230 --> 00:09:49.150
You must practice secretly often.

00:09:53.980 --> 00:09:57.150
We are sure to win the game with you here!

00:09:58.990 --> 00:10:00.700
No problem, consider it done.

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:03.040
Don't walk on air, Cheng Xiaoshi!

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:04.790
We can't change the game's result!

00:10:05.910 --> 00:10:10.630
But it cannot be done by me alone, right?

00:10:10.630 --> 00:10:11.790
--Cheng Xiaoshi,
--Get ready for the second half!

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:13.920
--your mission is not to win the game.
--Get ready for the second half!

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:14.920
Stop at the right time.

00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:16.720
Okay, I got this.

00:10:21.930 --> 00:10:24.470
Hong Bin, take it easy.

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:25.770
Sit down, please.

00:10:39.950 --> 00:10:42.990
You are nothing without him!

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:45.580
Why did he pass me in such a case?

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:53.000
How is going?

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:55.590
Have you seen my revenge?

00:10:55.590 --> 00:10:57.130
Is my acting good?

00:10:57.130 --> 00:10:58.380
Did it look like a real turnover?

00:10:58.380 --> 00:10:59.840
What did he do just now?

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:01.680
--Why backdoor?
--Don't you forget it.

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:04.510
Basketball is a team sport.

00:11:04.510 --> 00:11:06.390
Chen Xiao deliberately ran
out of the free-throw lane

00:11:06.390 --> 00:11:08.640
to attract their attention,

00:11:08.640 --> 00:11:11.480
and clear a way for you to
creating scoring opportunities!

00:11:12.730 --> 00:11:13.690
I see!

00:11:13.690 --> 00:11:15.270
Chen is not only good at fighting alone,

00:11:15.270 --> 00:11:17.320
but also good at devising strategies
and deploying forces!

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:18.650
That's awesome!

00:11:30.120 --> 00:11:31.120
Gosh!

00:11:32.580 --> 00:11:33.830
Good pass!

00:11:37.340 --> 00:11:40.720
Wow, Chen Xiao, this pass is
no lesser than Magic Johnson's!

00:11:40.720 --> 00:11:41.840
That's wonderful!

00:11:41.840 --> 00:11:44.180
You just pass the ball,
we will move actively to keep up with you!

00:11:44.180 --> 00:11:46.350
Yeah, okay.

00:11:46.350 --> 00:11:48.930
What was going on?

00:11:48.930 --> 00:11:52.060
That ball must be dumb luck!

00:12:09.240 --> 00:12:10.450
Keep on going!

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:20.050
Well, I tried.

00:12:21.010 --> 00:12:23.260
Suspension from
Motor Factory Middle School.

00:12:26.010 --> 00:12:29.640
Long Yang Long Yang, reign the court!

00:12:29.640 --> 00:12:33.190
Long Yang Long Yang, through the storm!

00:12:33.190 --> 00:12:34.520
Sit down!

00:12:35.850 --> 00:12:36.730
Oh, no.

00:12:36.730 --> 00:12:39.480
Was it seen through?

00:12:39.480 --> 00:12:42.610
You have deformation action
because your body is heavily exhausted.

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:44.070
Just take a break.

00:12:46.450 --> 00:12:48.580
The school doctor has done
emergency treatment for me.

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:51.040
Now it's my turn.

00:12:59.420 --> 00:13:03.340
He can really play with that limp?

00:13:03.340 --> 00:13:05.220
If he doesn't play now,

00:13:05.220 --> 00:13:08.760
maybe there will be no more chances
for him in the future.

00:13:08.760 --> 00:13:10.850
Our town is not big,

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:13.600
so the resources are
limited for our school.

00:13:13.600 --> 00:13:19.520
This basketball hall was a reconstruction
of the old factory built by the workers.

00:13:19.520 --> 00:13:21.070
Then the factory closed.

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:23.820
The students who like basketball
were always playing here.

00:13:23.820 --> 00:13:26.240
The school couldn't care less about that.

00:13:26.240 --> 00:13:30.120
But they will build an extension
onto the school soon.

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:32.490
If we achieve good results
on behalf of the school,

00:13:32.490 --> 00:13:34.910
can we keep the hall?

00:13:34.910 --> 00:13:38.000
Our school never had a basketball team.

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:40.250
That's just monkey business.

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:41.630
Anyway,

00:13:41.630 --> 00:13:43.210
please let's have a try!

00:13:45.470 --> 00:13:47.840
In a rural school like this,

00:13:47.840 --> 00:13:51.600
studying is the only way
to get ahead in life.

00:13:51.600 --> 00:13:56.560
The basketball dream is just like
the Arabian Nights for them.

00:13:58.980 --> 00:14:00.270
Coach,

00:14:00.270 --> 00:14:02.070
please put me on the court.

00:14:02.070 --> 00:14:03.820
Don't call me that,

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:06.200
don't you forget, I'm a chemistry teacher.

00:14:06.200 --> 00:14:09.660
What's wrong with you kids?

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:15.500
What does basketball mean to you?

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:17.330
Well done, new boy,

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:20.250
we'll be partners in the future.

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:21.500
Just for fun.

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:23.090
Why do you take it so seriously?

00:14:23.090 --> 00:14:25.210
That's not true.

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:27.550
Whenever I pass to you,

00:14:27.550 --> 00:14:29.680
it represents my trust in you.

00:14:31.010 --> 00:14:37.600
How precious it is to be with
trustworthy partners in our life.

00:14:55.740 --> 00:14:58.500
Cheng Xiaoshi,
remember you're in the past,

00:14:58.500 --> 00:15:00.040
living in another person's life!

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:02.880
I know.

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:07.170
What precisely I need to do is
make up for his regrets in the past!

00:15:26.820 --> 00:15:28.240
Offense rebound off!

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:38.580
Captain!

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:42.290
Coach, substitution please!

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:45.670
Captain!

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:47.500
Captain, you don't have to do this!

00:15:54.300 --> 00:15:56.470
Suspension from
Motor Factory Middle School.

00:15:58.600 --> 00:15:59.980
Captain,

00:15:59.980 --> 00:16:01.140
are you okay?

00:16:02.640 --> 00:16:04.560
I can't...

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:06.520
I really can't bear it.

00:16:08.280 --> 00:16:10.490
This won't be

00:16:10.490 --> 00:16:13.030
your last game here!

00:16:17.530 --> 00:16:18.700
Cheng Xiaoshi,

00:16:18.700 --> 00:16:20.250
don't forget our appointed roles!

00:16:52.950 --> 00:16:53.950
Watch out!

00:17:10.090 --> 00:17:12.550
What? Is that guy really flying?

00:17:14.970 --> 00:17:16.260
It's wonderful!

00:17:21.010 --> 00:17:22.680
The gap has narrowed to only three points!

00:17:22.680 --> 00:17:24.270
We still have a chance!

00:17:24.270 --> 00:17:25.980
This defense is of vital importance.

00:17:25.980 --> 00:17:27.690
Man-on-man defense!

00:17:53.800 --> 00:17:55.590
Foul from Long Yang Middle School!

00:17:56.550 --> 00:17:58.510
Apologies, my brother,

00:17:58.510 --> 00:17:59.850
I want a cooperative defense.

00:17:59.850 --> 00:18:01.760
Sorry about your glasses.

00:18:04.680 --> 00:18:05.890
Thank you.

00:18:07.310 --> 00:18:08.310
Hurry up,

00:18:08.310 --> 00:18:10.440
we have a bus back to the county
to catch after the game.

00:18:10.440 --> 00:18:13.980
Long Yang Long Yang, reign the court!

00:18:13.980 --> 00:18:17.910
Long Yang Long Yang, through the storm!

00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:32.540
What the hell?

00:18:32.540 --> 00:18:34.250
Three-point shot!

00:18:38.220 --> 00:18:39.220
We must control the ball,

00:18:39.220 --> 00:18:40.890
and eat up the clock!

00:18:55.320 --> 00:18:57.030
Bounce pass!

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:08.500
Stop here,

00:19:08.500 --> 00:19:10.460
this is the best ending.

00:19:19.130 --> 00:19:20.430
Just quit.

00:19:21.760 --> 00:19:22.800
Cheng Xiaoshi!

00:19:22.800 --> 00:19:24.010
Give it to him!

00:19:25.640 --> 00:19:27.060
Double team the back-up!

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:47.160
What does basketball mean to you?
